# TWC Mission Server Cline Rules

## Purpose
Workspace-level rules for Cline in VS Code. This file is the Cline equivalent of Continue's `.continue/rules/*.md` and is auto-injected into every Cline prompt in this workspace (no `globs:` scoping available). Keep it markdown-only and concise.

## Conventions
- Line endings: CRLF only (verify with `git ls-files --eol`; never introduce mixed endings).
- C# / .NET Framework targeting the IL-2 CloD engine (Team Fusion 4.312+ / Desert Wings Tobruk / Blitz).
- Scripts require `#define DEBUG` / `#define TRACE` and `//$reference parts/core/gamePlay.dll` (etc.) at the top.
- Credit TWC - The Wrecking Crew (http://twcclan.com/) for reuse/snippets.

## Overall Project layout - several missions and independent modules in different directories
Only the files within ./Genghis are actively being developed in now and should be actively consulted for relevant information and possible cross-module interaction, and actively edited.  The rest are older campaigns and missions that are no longer being actively developed - of possible interest for history or specific techniques, but most everything of interest is already in ./Genghis.

